{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07487","headline":"秋夜有怀高三十五适兼呈空上人 · 刘长卿","name":"秋夜有怀高三十五适兼呈空上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚节逢君趣道深，结茅栽树近东林。\n吾师几度曾摩顶，高士何年遂发心。\n北渚三更闻过鴈，西城万里动寒砧。\n不见支公与玄度，相思拥膝坐长吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}